        "print(day_df.describe())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cleaning Data\n",
        "Berdasarkan hasil asesmen, tidak ditemukan data hilang maupun duplikat. Namun, ada beberapa perbaikan format agar analisis lebih intuitif:\n",
        "1. Mengubah kolom `dteday` ke tipe `datetime`.\n",
        "2. Melakukan *mapping* kode numerik pada kolom `season` dan `workingday` menjadi teks eksplisit (*Spring*, *Summer*, *Fall*, *Winter*, serta *Hari Kerja* vs *Hari Libur / Akhir Pekan*)."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TgFXV0Yanu5_"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8HjeXte-nwGa"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Cleaning Data\n",
        "# 1. Konversi dteday ke datetime\n",
        "day_df['dteday'] = pd.to_datetime(day_df['dteday'])\n",
        "\n",
        "# 2. Mapping label kategorikal\n",
        "season_mapper = {1: 'Spring', 2: 'Summer', 3: 'Fall', 4: 'Winter'}\n",
        "day_df['season_label'] = day_df['season'].map(season_mapper)\n",
        "\n",
        "workingday_mapper = {0: 'Hari Libur / Akhir Pekan', 1: 'Hari Kerja'}\n",
        "day_df['workingday_label'] = day_df['workingday'].map(workingday_mapper)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Cek hasil perbaikan\n",
        "day_df[['dteday', 'season_label', 'workingday_label']].head()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
        "\n",
        "Pada tahap eksplorasi data, kita mengeksplorasi data untuk menjawab **kedua pertanyaan bisnis** yang telah didefinisikan sebelumnya."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QoIV0ZlHrhZx"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dFbRnBfVtk7E"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# EDA Pertanyaan 1: Rata-rata penyewaan sepeda berdasarkan Musim dan Tipe Hari pada Tahun 2012\n",
        "df_2012 = day_df[day_df['yr'] == 1]\n",
        "print(\"=== EDA Pertanyaan 1: Rata-rata Penyewaan per Musim & Tipe Hari (2012) ===\")\n",
        "print(df_2012.groupby(['season_label', 'workingday_label'])['cnt'].agg(['mean', 'median', 'std', 'min', 'max']))\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60 + \"\\n\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# EDA Pertanyaan 2: Binning kategori suhu dan distribusi penyewaan\n",
        "bins = [0, 0.3, 0.6, 1.0]\n",
        "labels = ['Dingin', 'Sedang', 'Panas']\n",
        "day_df['temp_category'] = pd.cut(day_df['temp'], bins=bins, labels=labels)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=== EDA Pertanyaan 2: Rata-rata & Statistik Penyewaan Berdasarkan Kategori Suhu (2011-2012) ===\")\n",
        "print(day_df.groupby('temp_category', observed=False)['cnt'].agg(['mean', 'median', 'std', 'min', 'max', 'count']))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Export Cleaned Data\n",
        "Menyimpan data hasil pembersihan ke dalam file `main_data.csv` yang nantinya akan dibaca oleh aplikasi dashboard Streamlit."
